      "created_at": "2017-08-02T20:04:38.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>My favorite fear card I've run into. &nbsp;Of course it was flipped by bringer right when coastal lands were about to build and we pushed towns to 4 coastal lands and only two built, and almost every one was cleared by the ensuing ravage, and only 1 built for England's 2nd build phase.</p><p>That swung the hardest game I had tried from \"Holy Crap, what did I get myself into?\" to \"Holy Carp, we got this!\"</p>",
